            "review_text": "NorthStar07602083308\n6 contributions\n0\nGreat place to dine in\nNov 2023 • Family\nMorico is highly praised for its fresh and high-quality sushi, making it a standout for sushi lovers. The restaurant offers a cozy, minimalist atmosphere with attentive service and a menu that includes well-prepared sushi, sashimi, and other traditional Japanese dishes. While prices are slightly higher than average, the quality of the food and overall dining experience make it a great value. If you’re a fan of sushi, Morico is definitely worth a visit.\nCasual or business dress code\nI have been there few years ago...\nRead more\nWritten October 4, 2024",
